2026-11-05T09:26:03 0x004941b0 data ai_Unk4941b0 -> ai_DecideTorture by:main why:the trial's ask-AI callback ai_Unk4de340 (cm.c 0x4de340, registered as the trial's other-members callback in cm_InitScenes) answers request kind 1 with 0x4941b0: the accuser (m[5] = ids[0]) decides whether to torture (cm_RunTrial sets plan.tortured on answer == 1, cm_TrialAskPlayer's mode 1 asks the same question of the player); kind 2 with 0x4941d0: the accuser's torture instrument, a random 0..6 of the seven (plan.instrument, cm_TrialAskPlayer's mode 2 picks order[cm_Random(3)])
2026-11-05T09:26:03 0x004941d0 data ai_Unk4941d0 -> ai_DecideTortureInstrument by:main why:the trial's ask-AI callback ai_Unk4de340 (cm.c 0x4de340, registered as the trial's other-members callback in cm_InitScenes) answers request kind 1 with 0x4941b0: the accuser (m[5] = ids[0]) decides whether to torture (cm_RunTrial sets plan.tortured on answer == 1, cm_TrialAskPlayer's mode 1 asks the same question of the player); kind 2 with 0x4941d0: the accuser's torture instrument, a random 0..6 of the seven (plan.instrument, cm_TrialAskPlayer's mode 2 picks order[cm_Random(3)])
2026-11-05T09:26:47 0x004941e0 data ai_Unk4941e0 -> ai_DecideTortureMercy by:main why:the trial's ask-AI callback ai_Unk4de340 answers request kind 3 with it: the torturer (m[10] = ids[5], checked as the player's case 3 of cm_TrialAskPlayer) decides whether to give in; the answer 1 sends the relation event 0x23 to the accused (cm_TrialAskPlayer case 3 does the same on giving in). The body compares the torturer's (c28 = ids[5]) liking of the accused (c18 = ids[1]) and of the accuser (c14 = ids[0]): 1 when the accused leads by over 20, 0 when the accuser does, else a coin toss
2026-11-05T09:27:38 0x004948c0 data ai_Unk4948c0 -> ai_FindInstrumentRecord by:main why:the record of the seven torture-instrument table records 0x5ecfd8 whose key is the index (0..6): ai_PlanRollTries looks it up by q->instrument (AIPLAN.instrument, the trial's torture instrument) for the amount base and spread of its rolls; the table is read only there
